{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3490730/extras/02d88a792d72c9aaf877ae55a1bbde19.avif?t=1770740259\" width=1000 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A wicked sorcerer is summoning monsters and wrecking the world\u2026 which is very inconvenient for the mail schedule. Caught in the middle are Fuzz &amp; Dizzy, two part-time mail carriers who somehow stumble into an epic magical mess. Deliver letters, visit amazing places, and meet delightfully weird characters along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3490730/extras/40297840cb406a22c6a7f37b01b587f6.poster.avif?t=1770740259\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3490730/extras/40297840cb406a22c6a7f37b01b587f6.webm?t=1770740259\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3490730/extras/40297840cb406a22c6a7f37b01b587f6.mp4?t=1770740259\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3490730/extras/7eceb43c99d161bd3a39d4a7ba88c444.avif?t=1770740259\" width=1000 height=200 /></span>Explore a colorful, platforming world alongside the half-brothers.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u2013Perfect Team Synergy</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can\u2019t go solo\u2014these brothers stick together! Fuzz and Dizzy must travel everywhere as a duo, using their unique abilities to access new areas and overcome all kinds of obstacles. Solve puzzles, chat with NPCs, and uncover hidden treasures along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3490730/extras/dcc4ccf642b6072316b33436bbc0cac3.poster.avif?t=1770740259\" width=720 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3490730/extras/dcc4ccf642b6072316b33436bbc0cac3.webm?t=1770740259\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3490730/extras/dcc4ccf642b6072316b33436bbc0cac3.mp4?t=1770740259\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u2013 Interactive Turn-Based Battles</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fuzz and Dizzy have a wide variety of abilities, each with unique traits designed to take on enemies with different strengths and weaknesses. On top of that, every skill features action-button inputs: time them right to deal maximum damage\u2014or dodge enemy attacks like a pro.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3490730/extras/70c2b869941ec7c4a2cd30dedd60ac4c.poster.avif?t=1770740259\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3490730/extras/70c2b869941ec7c4a2cd30dedd60ac4c.webm?t=1770740259\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3490730/extras/70c2b869941ec7c4a2cd30dedd60ac4c.mp4?t=1770740259\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3490730?t=1770740259","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackgrou